1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,526
Capillarity is all around you.

2
00:00:02,526 --> 00:00:04,205
Oil climbs a lamp wick.

3
00:00:04,205 --> 00:00:07,291
Water rises through the narrow vessels of a tree.

4
00:00:07,291 --> 00:00:09,257
Ink soaks into blotting paper.

5
00:00:09,257 --> 00:00:18,906
And farmers in the Terai plough their fields after rain to break the fine capillaries in the soil, so the water is not drawn up to the surface and lost.

